Lexicon/Dictionary: Define word meanings and their logical representations

Grammar Engine: Parse sentences using formal grammar rules (CCG, LFG, or CFG)

Semantic Translator: Convert parse trees into logical forms (e.g., ∀x(Man(x) → Mortal(x)))

Reasoner: Query the knowledge base and prove/disprove statements

Conversational Interface: Handle declarative statements and yes/no questions

